    <title>
        2026.9.10: fix new-note selection, prune orphaned audio, switch to Ca…
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-10T14:48:49Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63473642?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>candemircan</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/candemircan</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;2026.9.10: fix new-note selection, prune orphaned audio, switch to CalVer

`prop:due` matches no new card (new cards hold a queue position, not a due
date), so the nightly run never refreshed new notes. Select the lowest queue
positions explicitly instead.

Delete generated audio that no note references, as part of `run`.

Version is now CalVer (YYYY.M.D) rather than 0.x.y.&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
